# Big, high-churn build output: rewritten wholesale by presenter/refresh.sh
# and undeltifiable, so it stays out of history. Rebuild with:
#   bash presenter/refresh.sh --deck-only
/livecode-presenter.html
/livecode-presenter.pdf

# Committed on purpose, for contrast: figures/ costs a full re-capture to
# reproduce (clean demo tree, five step-branch boots, a headless browser and
# a headed one under Xvfb), and slides.html is ~0.3 MB of text. Both are
# cheap to carry.

# Build junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor / OS droppings
.DS_Store
*.swp
